    "updated_at": "2018-10-26T10:15:20Z",
    "body": "We could look at the element's video tracks to say whether there should be an image, but they could go away and the element would still show an old image that we should be able to draw. Perhaps it'd be better to look at `videoWidth` and `videoHeight`:\r\n> If _image_'s [videoWidth](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#dom-video-videowidth) and [videoHeight](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#dom-video-videoheight) attribtues are both 0, then return bad.",
