    "updated_at": "2023-03-10T18:46:05Z",
    "body": "I'd have to do more digging, it looks like we actually draw nothing nowadays:\r\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/canvas/canvas2d/base_rendering_context_2d.cc;l=1678;drc=8987a17e4855762850bb276ec150198aab415775\r\n\r\nBut there are still some paths (which may now be unreachable) where a black frame might be drawn:\r\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:media/renderers/paint_canvas_video_renderer.cc;l=1002;drc=8987a17e4855762850bb276ec150198aab415775",
